WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The readout board

00:04.000 --> 00:22.000
Plug each sensor's flex tail into its readout board

00:22.000 --> 00:54.000
Line the four sensor arrays up edge to edge

00:54.000 --> 01:14.000
Cover the arrays with piezoresistive film

01:14.000 --> 01:32.000
Connect the readout boards to the computer

01:32.000 --> 01:34.000
Run the live view and check that the board LEDs light up
